  Slug: adept-benefit-lantern
  DisplayName: Adept Benefit (Lantern)
  IconPath: icons/sundries/lights/lantern-iron-lit-yellow.webp
  Description: In addition to the initiate benefits, when you hold your lantern,
    its light reveals the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Invisible] and
    the ethereal. The bright light increases to 30 feet, with dim light out 30 feet
    further. While you're holding your lantern, invisible and ethereal creatures
    within the bright light become visible as rippling distortions, though they're
    still @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed]. This doesn't give
    you any special ability to affect a creature on the Ethereal Plane, but it ensures
    you're aware of the creatures' presence.
